WEBVTT

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:07.740
I'm late!

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:10.600
I'm off to school, Grandpa!

00:02:10.600 --> 00:02:12.480
You're wide open!

00:02:16.540 --> 00:02:18.780
See that? That was
one of my secret moves.

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:21.110
The unstoppable
Shinkugiri <b><i>(Crimson Cut).</i></b>

00:02:22.450 --> 00:02:25.990
Takao. You promised to
stop playing with those tops

00:02:25.990 --> 00:02:29.920
and begin your Ryushinken training.

00:02:32.790 --> 00:02:33.830
Huh?

00:02:33.930 --> 00:02:35.590
Takao...

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:40.370
My bonsai!

00:02:40.620 --> 00:02:42.340
I'm off!

00:02:42.340 --> 00:02:44.000
Hey! Wait!

00:02:44.520 --> 00:02:46.590
My precious bonsai...

00:02:46.590 --> 00:02:49.040
I won't forgive you, Takao!

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:57.060
Sorry, Grandpa.

00:02:57.850 --> 00:03:01.920
But I can't quit Beyblade just yet.

00:03:02.320 --> 00:03:06.110
The real battles come now that I've become the best in the world.

00:03:18.470 --> 00:03:20.020
I totally saw it, Kyoujyu!

00:03:20.020 --> 00:03:21.600
I saw it too!

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:23.880
The Russian tournament was so cool!

00:03:23.880 --> 00:03:25.710
It was so freakin' exciting!

00:03:25.710 --> 00:03:29.400
For real! I've never seen
battles like that before.

00:03:29.400 --> 00:03:31.270
It was so cool. Yup.

00:03:31.440 --> 00:03:34.260
But I didn't do anything.

00:03:34.260 --> 00:03:35.800
No way!

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:38.740
Takao and the others were able to win because you were there.

00:03:43.180 --> 00:03:46.750
After defeating the Russian team at the world championships,

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:49.360
we instantly became household names.

00:03:50.120 --> 00:03:53.920
But the BBA team
has split up for now.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:04:00.280
Max is helping his parents in America with the development of new Beyblades.

00:04:01.530 --> 00:04:03.380
Rei went back to China,

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:07.150
to spread Beyblade's
popularity and train kids.

00:04:07.880 --> 00:04:10.320
Kai hasn't contacted us since then,

00:04:10.320 --> 00:04:13.700
so I don't know where
he is or what he's doing.

00:04:14.240 --> 00:04:15.960
And Takao is...

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:25.590
I can't skip breakfast!

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:27.990
Kyoujyu!

00:04:28.640 --> 00:04:31.230
The Super Akebono
Beyblade Tournament is today.

00:04:31.230 --> 00:04:32.780
Takao's entered, right?

00:04:32.780 --> 00:04:35.740
He'll show us an amazing battle, right?

00:04:36.040 --> 00:04:38.760
Yes. I'll let him know.

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:45.030
Is Kinomiya going to make it?

00:04:45.030 --> 00:04:46.000
Huh?

00:04:46.000 --> 00:04:48.300
The teacher's not here yet!

00:04:48.300 --> 00:04:49.520
I'm safe!

00:04:49.520 --> 00:04:52.280
I turned it around for the big win!

00:04:53.260 --> 00:04:56.480
Umm... I think you're out...

00:04:58.480 --> 00:04:59.940
Ms. Keiko!

00:05:04.080 --> 00:05:07.700
Did your alarm clock stop again?

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:09.710
The late world champion!

00:05:10.880 --> 00:05:13.210
Now now, quiet everyone...

00:05:13.210 --> 00:05:15.520
It's time for class.

00:05:15.810 --> 00:05:19.190
You've been too lax lately, Takao.

00:05:19.190 --> 00:05:22.750
You understand, right?
The tournament's today.

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:26.590
Not to worry! It's a tournament
sponsored by a supermarket, right?

00:05:26.770 --> 00:05:28.970
I don't know who'll be there,

00:05:28.970 --> 00:05:31.510
but they don't stand
a chance against me.

00:05:31.510 --> 00:05:34.480
Like I said, that easy-
going attitude of yours will...

00:05:34.480 --> 00:05:36.600
Excuse me, you two,

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:37.930
may I continue with the lesson?

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:39.570
Be my guest!

00:05:39.570 --> 00:05:41.370
Keep going and don't stop!

00:05:41.370 --> 00:05:43.760
Time for class!

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:47.390
Now then, Mr. Kinomiya,
will you read the next piece?

00:05:47.390 --> 00:05:49.710
From page 58, section eight.

00:05:49.710 --> 00:05:50.860
Yes ma'am!

00:05:54.230 --> 00:05:56.410
I forgot my textbook!

00:05:58.480 --> 00:06:02.410
--Takao!

00:06:02.410 --> 00:06:05.200
Now, now, quiet down, kids.
--Takao!

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:05.990
--Takao!

00:06:08.340 --> 00:06:10.810
Is there a problem, Ms. Tachibana?

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:13.260
Do something about this, Ms. Keiko!

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:15.180
Ever since Kinomiya came back,

00:06:15.180 --> 00:06:18.960
the class has been all messed up.
We can't learn like this!

00:06:19.240 --> 00:06:21.960
Really? A little fun is okay, right?

00:06:21.960 --> 00:06:27.070
Ms. Keiko! Are you saying it's okay
for our class to completely fall apart?

00:06:27.070 --> 00:06:29.130
That would be bad, yes...

00:06:29.360 --> 00:06:33.050
Give guys like Takao an
inch and they take a mile!

00:06:33.280 --> 00:06:36.430
If you aren't a little hard on them,
they won't learn discipline!

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:39.680
Who does Hiromi think she is anyway?

00:06:40.020 --> 00:06:42.140
As class president, this is what I propose.

00:06:42.140 --> 00:06:45.690
As punishment for distracting the class,

00:06:45.900 --> 00:06:50.490
how does cleaning duty
for one week sound?

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:52.170
Hold on!

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:55.370
But he's not doing
it out of malice, so...

00:06:55.850 --> 00:06:57.840
--Clean the class!

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:01.010
C'mon, guys! Cut it out!

00:07:01.010 --> 00:07:05.040
Well, that's that. Your punishment is cleaning duty for one week.

00:07:06.980 --> 00:07:10.880
Ms. Keiko! I've got something
really important today...

00:07:10.880 --> 00:07:14.200
But it seems like everyone
has made their decision, so...

00:07:14.430 --> 00:07:16.410
Ms. Keiko...

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:20.530
I don't know what you're the world champion
of, but you only have yourself to blame.

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:22.820
I won't forget this...

00:07:23.840 --> 00:07:25.700
The tournament...!

00:07:31.040 --> 00:07:34.040
It sure is slow around here...

00:07:46.240 --> 00:07:48.940
A new recruit!

00:08:16.910 --> 00:08:18.830
Just a bunch of comic books...

00:08:24.550 --> 00:08:27.990
So slow! What's taking them so long?

00:08:28.220 --> 00:08:31.280
Are you going to join or not?

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:38.350
I don't need an entry fee! Come back!

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:43.510
Let's go, Kyoujyu.

00:08:43.510 --> 00:08:44.400
Let's hurry.

00:08:44.400 --> 00:08:45.580
Not one more step!

00:08:47.950 --> 00:08:49.400
Hiromi!

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:51.360
Give me a break!

00:08:51.360 --> 00:08:54.390
I'm gonna be late if
I'm stuck here cleaning...

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:56.870
No. What's done is done.

00:08:57.070 --> 00:08:58.630
Come on! I'm begging you!

00:08:58.630 --> 00:08:59.920
Just for today!

00:08:59.920 --> 00:09:02.090
If you want to go home so badly,

00:09:02.090 --> 00:09:04.120
then why don't you help out?

00:09:05.960 --> 00:09:08.640
Well, I'll be going on ahead...

00:09:09.000 --> 00:09:10.660
Hurry, now!

00:09:10.660 --> 00:09:11.680
Kyoujyu!

00:09:11.680 --> 00:09:13.890
Here you go!

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:18.440
Fine!

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:20.390
I just have to do it!

00:09:23.430 --> 00:09:25.350
Takao Kinomiya...

00:09:25.350 --> 00:09:27.200
A special entrant...

00:09:37.390 --> 00:09:39.280
Everyone's trying at it!

00:09:54.420 --> 00:09:56.170
Six wins and two losses?

00:09:56.170 --> 00:09:57.790
Not bad.

00:09:58.770 --> 00:10:00.830
What could that be?

00:10:00.830 --> 00:10:02.370
Kyoujyu!

00:10:03.230 --> 00:10:05.210
Chairman Daitenji!

00:10:05.330 --> 00:10:07.020
So you were here?

00:10:07.020 --> 00:10:12.040
After hearing Kinomiya would show,
I wouldn't miss it for the world.

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:13.960
By the way, Chairman,

00:10:13.960 --> 00:10:16.030
what are those devices everyone has?

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:20.950
You mean the Battle Analyzer?

00:10:20.950 --> 00:10:22.460
Battle Analyzer?

00:10:22.460 --> 00:10:26.170
It's a new item
developed by the BBA.

00:10:26.490 --> 00:10:32.170
It records endurance and if you input a
battle's results, it displays your experience.

00:10:32.300 --> 00:10:37.830
In short, it's an item that allows you to accurately judge your own strength.

00:10:37.830 --> 00:10:39.600
That's how it works.

00:10:39.600 --> 00:10:45.840
It's important to know your own
abilities in order to advance as a Blader.

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:46.830
I agree.

00:10:48.770 --> 00:10:51.390
I see he's moving
up in the brackets.

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:57.620
Genta Takesa. He's an upcoming
Blader I've been keeping my eyes on.

00:10:57.620 --> 00:11:01.920
I imagine that he will be battling Takao.

00:11:01.920 --> 00:11:04.570
I guarantee it'll be an interesting match.

00:11:04.570 --> 00:11:05.730
Just a little longer.

00:11:05.730 --> 00:11:08.890
Let's go down to
watch his match.

00:11:08.890 --> 00:11:10.800
Yes, let's.

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:14.840
Go Shoot!

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:17.710
There we go! Go!

00:11:20.690 --> 00:11:24.140
Such incredible stability and
pure destructive force...

00:11:24.550 --> 00:11:28.730
I can see why they call him number one when it comes to talent.

00:11:29.730 --> 00:11:33.330
He might give Takao a hard time.

00:11:45.010 --> 00:11:47.680
This isn't funny.

00:11:47.680 --> 00:11:51.520
I was just a little tardy... Why
give me cleaning duty?

00:11:55.860 --> 00:11:57.860
I bet it's just getting good, too...

00:11:57.860 --> 00:11:59.860
Don't stop!

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:01.700
Yeah, yeah...

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:03.820
You sure have a lot of free time.

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:06.030
Don't you have anything else to do?

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:08.080
Don't worry about me.

00:12:08.790 --> 00:12:12.370
I'm just carrying out my
responsibility as class president.

00:12:12.460 --> 00:12:13.500
Wow, really?

00:12:13.670 --> 00:12:15.880
Well ain't you something special?

00:12:18.380 --> 00:12:20.340
Ow ow ow ow!

00:12:20.340 --> 00:12:23.220
My stomach hurts all of a sudden!

00:12:23.220 --> 00:12:24.800
Could you be any more obvious?

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:27.260
You should go into acting!

00:12:28.600 --> 00:12:30.060
I'm serious!

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:32.060
My stomach...

00:12:32.060 --> 00:12:34.400
It hurts! I can't go on!

00:12:34.400 --> 00:12:36.440
Whatever.

00:12:36.770 --> 00:12:40.480
Even if you keep this up
you still have to clean.

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:49.200
I'm gonna die...

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:52.450
No, you're lying! Really?

00:12:55.290 --> 00:12:56.250
Are you okay?

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:57.630
Ouch!!

00:12:57.630 --> 00:12:59.880
The pain! It hurts!

00:12:59.880 --> 00:13:04.050
This is bad! Ms. Keiko! Ms. Keiko!

00:13:09.310 --> 00:13:15.100
Thanks for coming to the Beyblade
tournament sponsored by Super Akebono!

00:13:15.100 --> 00:13:17.600
Now then, I--

00:13:19.570 --> 00:13:25.740
I'm Umikawa, your emcee
from the fish section!

00:13:28.910 --> 00:13:31.950
Thanks for coming!

00:13:34.500 --> 00:13:37.750
Man, what's keeping Takao?

00:13:39.710 --> 00:13:42.210
The finals are about to start!

00:13:57.100 --> 00:13:59.690
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:04.650
It's time for the finals of the Super Akebono Beyblade Tournament!

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:07.780
The rules are simple!
It's a one round match!

00:14:07.780 --> 00:14:11.370
The winner will be given the right

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:17.330
to battle Super Akebono's special guest, Takao Kinomiya, the world champion!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:25.880
Let's introduce the two who'll
be fighting in the finals!

00:14:25.880 --> 00:14:29.470
He's a regular "flying fish"!

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:34.060
He's made it this far with his
incredible power. Genta Takesa!

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:43.570
And his opponent is
a newcomer to Akebono!

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.280
He's completely mysterious!

00:14:46.320 --> 00:14:49.320
He has skillfully won
his way up to the finals!

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:53.120
His battle name is Mister X!

00:15:03.090 --> 00:15:04.500
Who is he?

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:06.460
This intensity...

00:15:11.050 --> 00:15:12.760
Hey, bro!

00:15:12.760 --> 00:15:14.180
He's...

00:15:22.600 --> 00:15:24.400
Nice to meetcha!

00:15:28.780 --> 00:15:33.410
Who will challenge Takao Kinomiya? Genta the Flying Fish?

00:15:33.410 --> 00:15:35.950
Or will it be Mister X?

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:39.000
Are you ready?

00:15:39.000 --> 00:15:41.670
Three! Two! One!

00:15:41.670 --> 00:15:43.540
Go Shoot!

00:15:43.540 --> 00:15:44.960
Let's do it!

00:16:11.530 --> 00:16:13.780
My Beyblade...

00:16:15.200 --> 00:16:17.120
H-how...!

00:16:25.630 --> 00:16:29.250
So incredible! So destructive!

00:16:29.250 --> 00:16:31.880
What a twist!

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:34.760
An incredible blast that demolished the flying fish!

00:16:34.760 --> 00:16:37.390
A perfect victory!

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:40.560
The winner of the Super Akebono
Beyblade Tournament...

00:16:40.560 --> 00:16:42.680
is Mister X!

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:46.520
The special battle with Takao
Kinomiya will be in a half hour!

00:16:46.520 --> 00:16:50.150
Look forward to an exciting battle!

00:16:54.660 --> 00:16:57.160
He's late. He's so late.

00:16:57.200 --> 00:16:58.530
Kyoujyu!

00:16:58.870 --> 00:17:01.540
Takao! What time do you think it is?

00:17:01.540 --> 00:17:04.460
Like you can talk! You ditched me!

00:17:04.670 --> 00:17:07.420
I had a rough time
getting out of there.

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.630
Takao...!

00:17:10.960 --> 00:17:12.970
You're not getting away with this!

00:17:12.970 --> 00:17:17.340
He's going to be stuck cleaning toilets and rabbit cages for the next month!

00:17:17.340 --> 00:17:19.600
It's well-drawn, isn't it?

00:17:19.600 --> 00:17:20.970
Ms. Keiko!

00:17:20.970 --> 00:17:25.020
Don't blame me for what happens later.

00:17:25.270 --> 00:17:30.070
Either way, I was so interested in
what's going here that I just had to.

00:17:30.190 --> 00:17:32.360
More importantly, who am I up against?

00:17:32.360 --> 00:17:34.190
Is he any good?

00:17:34.190 --> 00:17:35.950
About that...

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:37.410
Takao!

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:38.700
Oh, heya!

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:41.540
Jeez, dude! Don't worry me like that!

00:17:41.740 --> 00:17:43.250
Come on, this way.

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:44.620
Everyone's waiting!

00:17:44.620 --> 00:17:46.080
Sure! We'll talk later.

00:17:46.080 --> 00:17:47.250
Takao!

00:17:48.250 --> 00:17:50.090
Sorry to keep you waiting!

00:17:50.090 --> 00:17:53.340
Allow me to introduce today's special guest!

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:57.010
The winner of the world
championships and Akebono City's hero!

00:17:57.010 --> 00:17:59.680
You know him well! Takao Kinomiya!

00:18:00.930 --> 00:18:02.970
Thank you, thank you!

00:18:03.470 --> 00:18:04.730
Bro!

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:08.150
Sorry I kept you all waiting!

00:18:08.600 --> 00:18:12.400
I had cleaning duty
and it ran a little long!

00:18:15.860 --> 00:18:17.990
But boy am I touched!

00:18:17.990 --> 00:18:22.450
To think so many people
came out to see me battle!

00:18:22.620 --> 00:18:24.450
I won't let you guys down.

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:27.120
My battle's gonna get you all pumped!

00:18:27.120 --> 00:18:28.170
Honestly.

00:18:28.170 --> 00:18:29.920
He's getting ahead of himself.

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:34.340
Regardless, this battle is worth recording.

00:18:34.340 --> 00:18:36.260
I'm glad, Takao.

00:18:36.260 --> 00:18:39.930
Thanks for your passionate,
heartwarming battles in Russia.

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:42.640
You're the pride of this city!

00:18:42.640 --> 00:18:44.930
Well then, let me introduce him one more time!

00:18:44.930 --> 00:18:49.690
He won the main tournament, and
skillfully made his way up to Takao!

00:18:49.690 --> 00:18:51.860
Mister X!

00:18:53.110 --> 00:18:56.230
Sorry for making you wait so long.

00:18:57.690 --> 00:19:00.110
I thought you were going to bail

00:19:00.110 --> 00:19:01.740
because you were too scared.

00:19:01.740 --> 00:19:03.450
What?!

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:09.210
You look serious but you've
sure got a sense of humor!

00:19:09.620 --> 00:19:12.380
It's time for today's special event!

00:19:12.380 --> 00:19:15.380
Takao Kinomiya's battle begins!

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:17.130
Are you ready?

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:19.510
Let's do it!

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:22.430
Three!

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:23.550
Two!

00:19:23.890 --> 00:19:24.850
One!

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:27.100
Go Shoot!

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:32.560
Go, Dragoon!

00:19:33.690 --> 00:19:37.440
Takao unleashes a deadly assault!

00:19:37.610 --> 00:19:39.440
I'm gonna push you out!

00:19:39.440 --> 00:19:44.120
What's the matter, Mister X?
Were the finals just a fluke?

00:19:44.370 --> 00:19:48.410
It's amazing that he can
withstand Dragoon's assault.

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:50.370
But what's he planning?

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:53.710
This'll end it! Go, Dragoon!

00:19:54.540 --> 00:19:55.630
He dodged it!

00:19:55.880 --> 00:19:57.630
It's quick!

00:19:59.590 --> 00:20:01.550
He fooled me.

00:20:01.680 --> 00:20:03.840
But you won't
get away this time!

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:07.100
Takao Kinomiya...

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:08.680
You're not as good as they say.

00:20:08.680 --> 00:20:11.600
You won't beat my Bey
with attacks like those.

00:20:12.140 --> 00:20:14.350
What? You making fun of me?

00:20:15.860 --> 00:20:18.690
He's completely seeing
through Dragoon's moves.

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:21.570
But why? Why isn't he attacking?

00:20:21.570 --> 00:20:23.410
What's he waiting for?

00:20:23.740 --> 00:20:27.160
Did Takao forget
how to release his Sacred Beast?

00:20:27.780 --> 00:20:29.160
Darn!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:33.670
I think there's a thing or
two I need to teach you.

00:20:34.620 --> 00:20:38.130
You can't win with your own strength!

00:20:38.670 --> 00:20:39.880
What?!

00:20:40.170 --> 00:20:42.420
I won't lose to you!

00:21:07.030 --> 00:21:08.740
What a twist!

00:21:08.740 --> 00:21:11.240
Something unbelivable has happened!

00:21:11.240 --> 00:21:14.790
Kinomiya, the world champion, has completely lost to Mister X!

00:21:14.790 --> 00:21:17.580
What fearsome destructive force!

00:21:17.580 --> 00:21:20.170
Mister X is terrifying!

00:21:20.170 --> 00:21:22.880
Takao lost?

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:24.880
If you want revenge,

00:21:24.880 --> 00:21:26.640
I'll take you on whenever you want.

00:21:27.800 --> 00:21:30.680
My Dragoon...

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:32.790
That's impossible!

00:22:58.310 --> 00:23:02.060
Takao lost a battle against the mysterious boy!

00:23:02.060 --> 00:23:06.030
As the best in the world, how shocking is this?

00:23:06.030 --> 00:23:08.190
Huh? Not shocked at all?

00:23:08.740 --> 00:23:10.570
Well, this is Takao after all.

00:23:10.700 --> 00:23:12.450
But that's not the point!

00:23:12.450 --> 00:23:15.580
But powerful mysterious enemies have appeared before Max and Rei...!

00:23:16.080 --> 00:23:18.080
The mysteries just won't stop!

00:23:18.080 --> 00:23:20.580
Oops, that was an impression!

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:24.040
You won't want to miss
the next one, Chairman Daitenji!
